1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Remote work didn't make you
antisocial.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
It deleted the infrastructure.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,500
The office was ambient contact: hallway hellos, lunch invites,
someone's birthday cake.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Zero effort. Daily reps.
You never noticed.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Now the reps are gone
and nothing replaced them.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
You have to design what the office
gave you for free. Recurring events. Deliberate contact.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,500
Start with one social rep today. Link in bio.
